  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes the mountain’s slopes beyond the pavilion that stands at its peak.",
      "chapters": [
        1714
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei recalls that Limitless Demon Venerable’s left path passes Central Heaven Gate, Name Plaque Palace, Sun Palace, Five Deity Hall, Central Great Hall, Heaven Overseeing Tower, Forgotten Dao Lake, and finally Imperfection Regret Pavilion on the peak of Star Zone Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "house_central_heaven_gate",
        "loc_name_plaque_palace",
        "loc_sun_palace",
        "loc_five_deity_hall",
        "loc_central_great_hall",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "loc_forgotten_dao_lake",
        "loc_imperfection_regret_pavilion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same route is restated when Longevity Heaven enters the left path: it stops at Imperfection Regret Pavilion on the peak of Star Zone Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "left-path-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In an Olden Antiquity Era recollection, Limitless Demon Venerable goes up Star Zone Mountain, finds the pavilion at the peak, and later plays chess there with Star Constellation’s will. Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable later visits Imperfection Regret Pavilion, then shakes his head and leaves Star Zone Mountain. When Giant Sun Immortal Venerable tours Heavenly Court, he looks at the pavilion but does not ascend the mountain. During Longevity Heaven’s later attack, the chess image reappears at the peak of Star Zone Mountain inside the pavilion.",
      "chapters": [
        1714
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pavilion-site",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_olden",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable walks down Star Zone Mountain after judging that forcing the chess game would mean resisting the joint power of two venerables plus Heavenly Court’s replenishment.",
      "chapters": [
        1720
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "genesis-lotus-departure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
